This service runs Maia-3, a model of human chess moves by the Computational Social Science Lab (CSSLab),
University of Toronto: https://github.com/CSSLab/maia3 (AGPL-3.0), weights
https://huggingface.co/UofTCSSLab. Please cite the Maia-3 paper when you use its predictions.

It uses maia3-web by Geoffrey Plitt, Maia-3 in dependency-free TypeScript with int8 weights:
https://github.com/GeoffreyPlitt/maia3-web (AGPL-3.0), unmodified, as an npm dependency.

chess.js (BSD-2-Clause): https://github.com/jhlywa/chess.js
